    "html": "<article class=\"group relative w-full aspect-[4/5] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl bg-surface-container-lowest flex flex-col justify-between p-6\" data-category=\"citas\">\n<div class=\"safe-zone-overlay absolute inset-x-0 top-[10%] bottom-[10%] pointer-events-none hidden z-20\">\n<div class=\"w-full h-full border border-dashed border-secondary/40 rounded-xl bg-secondary/5 flex items-start justify-end p-2\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary bg-surface/90 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded\">1:1 SAFE</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-6\"></div>\n<!-- 1:1 Safe Zone Centered Content -->\n<div class=\"relative z-10 my-auto flex flex-col text-left space-y-3\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest\">BIOMECÁNICA DEL PIE</span>\n<h2 class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-light leading-snug\">\n            Una suela con 3 cm de espuma desconecta el 80% de tus mecanorreceptores plantares.\n          </h2>\n<p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed font-light\">\n            Si tus pies no sienten el suelo, tu rodilla y tu cadera tienen que inventar la estabilidad. Camina descalzo sobre superficies reales al menos 20 minutos al día.\n          </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"relative z-10 w-full flex items-center justify-between text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm\">\n<span>PROPIOCEPCIÓN</span>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">accessibility_new</span>\n</div>\n</article>"
