    "html": "<article class=\"group relative w-full aspect-[4/5] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl bg-surface-container-low flex flex-col justify-between p-7\" data-category=\"memos\">\n<div class=\"safe-zone-overlay absolute inset-x-0 top-[10%] bottom-[10%] pointer-events-none hidden z-20\">\n<div class=\"w-full h-full border border-dashed border-secondary/40 rounded-xl bg-secondary/5 flex items-start justify-end p-2\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary bg-surface/90 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded\">1:1 SAFE</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-6\"></div>\n<!-- 1:1 Safe Zone Centered Content -->\n<div class=\"relative z-10 my-auto flex flex-col text-left space-y-2.5\">\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-outline uppercase tracking-wider\">ESSAI 03 • SOBRE EL RITMO</span>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface leading-relaxed\">\n            La prisa moderna es un error ortopédico. Nos movemos rápido porque tememos quedarnos quietos con nuestras sensaciones corporales.\n          </p>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed\">\n            El entrenamiento somático exige la calma de un reloj de arena. Aprender a sostener 4 segundos en la fase excéntrica enseña más sobre paciencia que cualquier conferencia de liderazgo.\n          </p>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface leading-relaxed italic\">\n            El cuerpo siempre sabe cuándo lo estás apurando.\n          </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"relative z-10 w-full flex items-center justify-between text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm\">\n<span>MICRO-ENSAYO</span>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\">menu_book</span>\n</div>\n</article>"
